  (text "14-pin 0.5 mm flex sensor cartridge (Molex 503480-1400, dual contact; rated 10 mating cycles). Same pin 1 end on every sensor board.\n1 GND   2 VSENS   3 SDA   4 SCL   5 SCK   6 MOSI/TX\n7 MISO/RX   8 CS   9 INT   10 AIN   11 ID   12 GND   13 VBAT   14 GND\nVSENS is nPM1300 LSOUT1, fed from VOUT2. Enable it in firmware as a load switch.\nVBAT (pin 13) is raw, unswitched battery for actuators or sensors that need more than the 100 mA load switch; GND at both ends (1, 14) so a reversed cable cannot short it.\nI2C, INT, and CS pull-ups sit on VSENS so a powered-off sensor is not back-driven.\nID is 10k to VOUT2 here. Each sensor board adds its own resistor from ID to GND." 
    (exclude_from_sim no) 
    (at 104.902 30.734 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27))) 
